m:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.907" end="0:53.445">每逢过</span><span begin="0:53.445" end="0:53.566">节的</span><span begin="0:53.566" end="0:53.796">时</span><span begin="0:53.796" end="0:53.934">候</span> <span begin="0:53.934" end="0:54.146">少</span><span begin="0:54.146" end="0:54.325">不了</span><span begin="0:54.325" end="0:54.846">对父母的</span><span begin="0:54.846" end="0:55.096">那份</span><span begin="0:55.096" end="0:55.575">思念</span></p><p begin="0:55.715" end="0:58.366" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.715" end="0:56.436">不能回家</span> <span begin="0:56.436" end="0:56.625">因</span><span begin="0:56.625" end="0:57.103">为自己的</span><span begin="0:57.103" end="0:58.366">梦想还没有实现</span></p><p begin="0:58.512" end="1:01.152" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.512" end="0:58.700">他</span><span begin="0:58.700" end="0:58.880">们的</span><span begin="0:58.880" end="0:59.232">坚强</span> <span begin="0:59.232" end="0:59.403">他</span><span begin="0:59.403" end="0:59.550">们的</span><span begin="0:59.550" end="0:59.731">梦</span> <span begin="0:59.731" end="0:59.921">他</span><span begin="0:59.921" end="1:00.081">们的</span><span begin="1:00.081" end="1:01.152">苦只有自己懂</span></p><p begin="1:01.307" end="1:03.937" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.307" end="1:01.495">回</span><span begin="1:01.495" end="1:01.675">不到</span><span begin="1:01.675" end="1:02.015">曾经</span> <span begin="1:02.015" end="1:02.206">看</span><span begin="1:02.206" end="1:02.377">不到</span><span begin="1:02.377" end="1:02.728">未来</span> <span begin="1:02.728" end="1:02.866">一</span><span begin="1:02.866" end="1:03.567">切都是那</span><span begin="1:03.567" end="1:03.784">么的</span><span begin="1:03.784" end="1:03.937">空</span></p><p begin="1:04.115" end="1:06.713" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.115" end="1:04.334">还要</span><span begin="1:04.334" end="1:04.633">一</span><span begin="1:04.633" end="1:05.483">直拼命地走着</span> <span begin="1:05.483" end="1:05.672">用</spa